   102	## 跳到某個 tick：同一組陣型從頭快轉（確定性模擬，結果一定一樣），畫面與音效狀態清空重建。
   103	func _seek(target: int) -> void:
   104		_seek_begin(target)
   105		while not _seek_tick(1000000):
   106			pass
   107		_seek_finish()
   108	
   109	
   110	## 第七輪 M3：時間軸點下去不再卡畫面，分批算。headless 測試直接走 _seek。
   111	var _seek_stop := 0
   112	var _seek_ct := -1
   113	
   114	func _seek_async(target: int) -> void:
   115		if seek_target >= 0:
   116			return
   117		if DisplayServer.get_name() == "headless" or shot_dir != "":
   118			_seek(target)
   119			return
   120		seek_target = target
   121		_seek_begin(target)
   122	
   123	## 這一幀還在算就回傳 true（戰鬥畫面這一幀不動）。
   124	func _seek_pump() -> bool:
   125		if seek_target < 0:
   126			return false
   127		if _seek_tick(10):
   128			seek_target = -1
   129			_seek_finish()
   130		return true
   131	
   132	func _seek_begin(target: int) -> void:
   133		set("dir_hot_until", -1.0)   # 1.4.0：跳轉不帶舊的推近焦點（Codex cat05 #7）
   134		cues.clear()       # 1.3.0 §7.1：跳轉清掉預告（不留舊時間線的未來事件；Codex cat06 #2）
   135		stat_prev.clear()
   136		var armies2: Array = rv_last if play_kind == "review" and not rv_last.is_empty() else last_armies
   137		sim = Sim.new(armies2[0].copy(), armies2[1].copy(), battle_rules)
   138		call("_cmd_setup", sim, play_kind)
   139		ev_count = {}
   140		set("last_blast_tick", -99)
   141		_seek_ct = -1
   142		_seek_deaths = {}
   143		battle_marks.clear()
   144		first_fall = [-1, -1]
   145		var dl: int = ViewBuffer.DELAY if (bool(sim.get("cmd_on")) and not bool(sim.get("cmd_scripted"))) else ViewBuffer.DELAY_LONG   # 和 ViewBuffer 的選法一樣
   146		_seek_stop = maxi(0, target - (view.delay if view != null else dl))
   147		_seek_target_now = target
   148	
   149	var _seek_target_now := 0
   150	var _seek_deaths := {}   # V1.5.1 B2：快轉時誰在哪個 tick 倒下（跳轉後重建陣亡小旗）
   151	
   152	## 算到時間用完或到達目標；到達回傳 true。
   153	func _seek_tick(budget_ms: int) -> bool:
   154		var t0 := Time.get_ticks_msec()
   155		while sim.tick < _seek_stop and not sim.finished:
   156			if Time.get_ticks_msec() - t0 >= budget_ms:
   157				return false
   158			sim.step()
   159			for ev in sim.events:   # 快轉時也要累計戰報次數與時間軸標記（Codex S5 #4：共用同一個收集函式）
   160				if ev.has("src"):
   161					var s = sim.unit_by_id(ev["src"])
   162					var key := "%s%d" % [ev["kind"], s.team]
   163					ev_count[key] = int(ev_count.get(key, 0)) + 1
   164					if ev["kind"] == EV.BLAST and not ev.has("dmg"):
   165						ev_count["blast_fx%d" % s.team] = int(ev_count.get("blast_fx%d" % s.team, 0)) + 1
   166				_collect_mark(ev, sim, sim.tick)
   167				if ev["kind"] == EV.DEATH:
   168					_seek_deaths[int(ev["id"])] = sim.tick
   169				if ev["kind"] == EV.CMD:
   170					battle_marks.append({"tick": sim.tick, "kind": "cmd", "team": int(ev["team"]), "skill": int(ev["skill"])})   # V1.5.1：快轉也收軍令標記（原本跳轉後會漏）
   171			if _seek_ct < 0 and not sim.finished and clutch_cond(sim):
   172				_seek_ct = sim.tick
   173		return true
